WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.236 --> 00:00:01.628
Last year, here at Comic-Con,

00:00:01.628 --> 00:00:03.994
we had an unexpected guest drop in on us.

00:00:03.994 --> 00:00:05.530
It did not go well.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.700
I'll be honest.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.191
He was booed off the stage.

00:00:09.191 --> 00:00:12.072
Now he has demanded to
come back and visit again.

00:00:12.072 --> 00:00:15.544
This year, he's flown in
directly from his top-secret lair

00:00:15.544 --> 00:00:16.900
and golf club in Mar-a-Lago.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.954
Please welcome Captain
Make-America-Great-Again!

00:00:19.954 --> 00:00:22.010
(audience cheering)

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:23.025
Hello everybody!

00:00:23.025 --> 00:00:24.817
Wow, look at this!

00:00:24.817 --> 00:00:26.084
Hello everybody.

00:00:26.084 --> 00:00:27.137
How are you?

00:00:27.137 --> 00:00:28.572
Good to see ya.

00:00:28.572 --> 00:00:30.224
Thank you, Conan.

00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:31.700
Good to see you.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.533
You look tremendous.

00:00:34.738 --> 00:00:35.841
Hello, everyone.

00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:36.674
Thank you, Conan.

00:00:36.674 --> 00:00:39.552
And, and, please, please, please.

00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:41.653
(audience laughter)

00:00:41.653 --> 00:00:42.486
Correction.

00:00:42.486 --> 00:00:46.653
I am now no longer Captain
Make-America-Great-Again.

00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:52.847
I am President Captain
Make-America-Great-Again.

00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:55.680
(audience booing)

00:00:57.204 --> 00:00:58.444
Wow, wow.

00:00:58.444 --> 00:01:00.020
Listen to those woos.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.082
They're going nuts.

00:01:01.082 --> 00:01:02.237
I love it.

00:01:02.237 --> 00:01:03.070
Sure.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.958
I gotta be honest with you,
I don't think those are woos.

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:05.933
Oh, sure they are.

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:07.914
That's how these nerds cheer.

00:01:07.914 --> 00:01:10.704
(audience booing)

00:01:10.704 --> 00:01:14.727
I have had the greatest
year of any superhero

00:01:14.727 --> 00:01:17.986
in the history of superheroes ever.

00:01:17.986 --> 00:01:19.039
Hashtag ever.

00:01:19.039 --> 00:01:19.872
Okay, well.

00:01:19.872 --> 00:01:20.999
You know who's having.
(audience laughter)

00:01:20.999 --> 00:01:22.412
You know who's having an even bigger year?

00:01:22.412 --> 00:01:23.245
Wonder Woman.

00:01:23.245 --> 00:01:24.078
I'll be honest with you.

00:01:24.078 --> 00:01:28.245
Wonder Woman had a great year.
(audience cheering)

00:01:29.685 --> 00:01:30.518
No, no.

00:01:30.518 --> 00:01:32.437
Excuse me, excuse me.

00:01:32.437 --> 00:01:36.604
I do not want to talk about
crooked Wonder Woman, Conan.

00:01:37.626 --> 00:01:38.744
All right?

00:01:38.744 --> 00:01:42.465
She is a low-energy loser.
(crowd booing)

00:01:42.465 --> 00:01:43.298
No, no.

00:01:43.298 --> 00:01:44.421
There she is.

00:01:44.421 --> 00:01:45.280
What are you talking about?

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.113
What are you talking about?

00:01:46.113 --> 00:01:48.195
She has the number one
superhero movie this year.

00:01:48.195 --> 00:01:49.028
What are you talking about?

00:01:49.028 --> 00:01:50.155
(audience cheering)

00:01:50.155 --> 00:01:53.238
Wait, wait, wait, hold on.

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:54.196
Please, all right.

00:01:54.196 --> 00:01:57.913
I have proof there is
widespread viewer fraud.

00:01:57.913 --> 00:01:59.375
Now that sounds like

00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:01.720
one of your crazy conspiracy theories.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.715
I don't like her, all right?

00:02:02.715 --> 00:02:05.347
She walks around with that lasso of truth.

00:02:05.347 --> 00:02:06.769
Keep that thing away from me, Conan.

00:02:06.769 --> 00:02:09.461
(audience laughter)

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.990
I can see why you might have
a problem with that, yeah.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.168
And you know what else?

00:02:13.168 --> 00:02:15.501
I don't like San Diego.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:16.334
Oh my God.

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:19.739
(audience booing)

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:22.981
This time of year, the entire town smells

00:02:22.981 --> 00:02:26.136
like Jabba the Hutt died
inside of a fish taco.

00:02:26.136 --> 00:02:29.194
(audience laughter)

00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:30.974
(audience booing)

00:02:30.974 --> 00:02:32.557
Come on, come on.

00:02:34.422 --> 00:02:35.889
Thank you, thank you.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:36.724
Boo him all you want.

00:02:36.724 --> 00:02:37.557
That was a good one.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.703
(audience laughter)

00:02:39.703 --> 00:02:40.536
Now, wait, wait.

00:02:40.536 --> 00:02:42.343
If you hate it so much, in San Diego,

00:02:42.343 --> 00:02:43.481
why'd you come back?

00:02:43.481 --> 00:02:47.497
Well, my son wanted to check out Comic-Con

00:02:47.497 --> 00:02:50.011
for his 40th birthday.

00:02:50.011 --> 00:02:53.094
Come on out, Captain Make-America Jr.

00:02:54.813 --> 00:02:57.396
(heroic music)

00:03:03.731 --> 00:03:04.564
Look at him.

00:03:04.564 --> 00:03:07.357
Now that is a high-quality person.

00:03:07.357 --> 00:03:09.024
He looks tremendous!

00:03:10.051 --> 00:03:11.134
Uh, Junior.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:20.283
Junior, junior, junior. (laughs)

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.340
Are you enjoying Comic-Con?

00:03:25.723 --> 00:03:27.475
Captain-Make-America-Great-Again Jr.,

00:03:27.475 --> 00:03:28.430
are you enjoying it?

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.333
Oh yeah.

00:03:29.333 --> 00:03:33.419
This morning, I went to a
private panel in Room 823

00:03:33.419 --> 00:03:34.931
at the Downtown Westin.

00:03:34.931 --> 00:03:36.361
Okay, I'm sorry, that's confusing.

00:03:36.361 --> 00:03:37.869
A private panel in a hotel room?

00:03:37.869 --> 00:03:38.702
Yes.

00:03:38.702 --> 00:03:42.869
It was just me and
Captain Russia, Vodka Man,

00:03:42.987 --> 00:03:44.948
and Anna Kournikova.

00:03:44.948 --> 00:03:47.444
(audience cheering)

00:03:47.444 --> 00:03:50.486
I told you to stay in the car, you idiot.

00:03:50.486 --> 00:03:52.257
Conan, we gotta go.

00:03:52.257 --> 00:03:53.434
Well, thank you very much for stopping in.

00:03:53.434 --> 00:03:54.522
You guys really lifted our spirits.

00:03:54.522 --> 00:03:57.423
We are leaving San Diego.

00:03:57.423 --> 00:04:00.423
(audience cheering)

00:04:01.332 --> 00:04:03.124
Just like the Chargers.

00:04:03.124 --> 00:04:04.136
Hail Hydra.

00:04:04.136 --> 00:04:05.719
Hail Hydra, okay.

00:04:06.818 --> 00:04:09.401
(heroic music)

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:20.269
You really want to punch
that son, don't you?

